/-!
## Lemma 6.29 · `[TR]` p. 11 · `proved`

> If @ρ ⊐ α and ρ # ρ_v ● ℓ ↦ own(v) and ρ ● ℓ ↦ imm({α}, v, ρ_v) ↭ ρ′ then ρ′ = ρ′/ℓ ● ℓ ↦ imm({α}, v, ρ_v).

